t need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2b+(-3a+c) & =2\\,\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+(-3\\,\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}+(\\begin{bmatrix}12 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}10 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573284 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186573170 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573284 #edb/ref 1069 "q-1390" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573284 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573284 #edb/ref 1071 "If $\\overset{\\to }{c}=⟨12,-18⟩$, then $-\\frac{1}{3}\\overset{\\to }{c}=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573284 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "71659674-1123-5b9b-95e7-0ead2ac9950c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573284 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute $-\\frac{1}{3}\\overset{\\to }{c},$ we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{1}{3}\\overset{\\to }{c} & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot ⟨12,-18⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(-\\frac{1}{3})\\cdot 12,(-\\frac{1}{3})\\cdot (-18)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-4,6⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573293 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186573229 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573293 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186573231 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573293 #edb/ref 1069 "q-318162" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573293 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573293 #edb/ref 1071 "If $\\overset{\\to }{p}=⟨-1,5⟩,$ then $3\\overset{\\to }{p}=$$\\,⟨$\n{{field-1}}$\\,,$\n{{field-2}}$⟩.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573293 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "91b53c66-dd75-5cd1-95a9-a7a78fb6e36b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573293 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute the result, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3\\overset{\\to }{p} & =3\\cdot ⟨-1,5⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3\\cdot (-1),\\,3\\cdot 5⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-3,15⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573294 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186573221 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573294 #edb/ref 1069 "q-1306" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573294 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573294 #edb/ref 1071 "Let $u=⟨7,4⟩$ and $v=⟨9,11⟩.$ Find $-2u+v.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573294 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "933d30fa-71c5-533c-a1e8-a19050253145" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573294 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute $-2u+v,$ we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2u+v & =-2\\cdot ⟨7,4⟩+⟨9,11⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-14,-8⟩+⟨9,11⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-5,3⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573298 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186573156 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573298 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186573157 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573298 #edb/ref 1069 "q-275319" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573298 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573298 #edb/ref 1071 "If $a=5i-3j$ and $b=-i+5j,$ then $a+b=${{field-1}}$i\\,\\,+$\n{{field-2}}$j.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573298 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "aa045c10-f709-5818-81e4-f02ca81ca31a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573298 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute $a+b,$ we just need to compute all of the $i$'s and $j$'s, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a+b & =(5i-3j)+(-i+5j) \\\\  & =5i-3j-i+5j \\\\  & =(5i-i)+(-3j+5j) \\\\  & =4i+2j\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573310 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186573233 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573310 #edb/ref 1069 "q-125100" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573310 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573310 #edb/ref 1071 "If $\\overset{\\to }{u}=⟨4,-3⟩$ and $\\overset{\\to }{v}=⟨-1,2⟩$, then $2\\overset{\\to }{u}+\\overset{\\to }{v}=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573310 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "d424dcb1-177c-5053-898f-bbc5de5cd766" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573310 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute the result, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\overset{\\to }{u}+\\overset{\\to }{v} & =2\\cdot ⟨4,-3⟩+⟨-1,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨8,-6⟩+⟨-1,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨8+(-1),-6+2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨8-1,-6+2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨7,-4⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573312 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186573214 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573312 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186573218 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573312 #edb/ref 1069 "q-318154" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573312 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573312 #edb/ref 1071 "Let $a=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}$, $b=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}$ and $c=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}.$ Find $\\,4a-(3b-2c).$\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"1\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"25\">$4a-(3b-2c)=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"2\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"2\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"2\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">{{field-2}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"2\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573312 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "df07f0e4-b8c0-55c8-a0ad-afd25f375b3a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573312 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute the result, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4a-(3b-2c) & =4\\,\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}-(3\\,\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}-2\\,\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-20 \\\\ 12\\end{bmatrix}-(\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 12\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-20 \\\\ 12\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ -24\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-28 \\\\ 36\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573315 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186573212 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573315 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186573232 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573315 #edb/ref 1069 "q-318160" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573315 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573315 #edb/ref 1071 "If $\\overset{\\to }{m}=⟨-6,2⟩$ and $\\overset{\\to }{n}=⟨5,-8⟩$, then $\\overset{\\to }{m}-\\overset{\\to }{n}=$$\\,⟨$\n{{field-1}}$\\,,$\n{{field-2}}$⟩.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573315 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "e78eae91-aaf3-5f8b-9296-2cbaa295070f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573315 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute the result, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{m}-\\overset{\\to }{n} & =⟨-6,2⟩-⟨5,-8⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-6-5,\\,2-(-8)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-11,10⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573319 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186573177 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573319 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186573198 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573319 #edb/ref 1069 "q-318128" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573319 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573319 #edb/ref 1071 "If $a=⟨-4,6⟩$ and $b=⟨3,-5⟩$, then $a-b=$$\\,⟨$\n{{field-1}}$\\,,$\n{{field-2}}$⟩.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573319 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "ee2b51f4-f377-5233-82c8-37f171607ed7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573319 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute $a-b,$ we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a-b & =⟨-4,6⟩-⟨3,-5⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-4-3,6-(-5)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-7,11⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
